!Series_summary = RNAseq was used to identify host and viral transcriptome changes in UHRF1 knock-out RaeL cells.  UHRF1 KO RaeL cells were subjected to FACSort for ICAM1+ subpopulations, which were further used for RNAseq analysis. The RaeL cells expressing control sgRNA was used as the control.
!Series_overall_design = UHRF1 KO RaeL cells were subjected to FACSort for ICAM1+ subpopulations, which were further used for RNAseq analysis. The RaeL cells expressing control sgRNA was used as the control.
